# No legacy / no backwards compatibility

This tree is WIP. When a layout, path, or API changes, **replace it**. Do not keep readers, fallbacks, migrators, or dual-write for the old form.

- Do not add `if old file exists, use it` after a rename
- Do not parse the previous on-disk format "just in case"
- Do not keep compatibility aliases, shims, or "legacy still works" branches
- Update exampleRepo and tests to the new form in the same change

Existing machines are expected to be reinstalled or adjusted. Move quickly.
